---
.title = "Platform hooks",
.description = "React to or take over the platform's own app, window and web view events: Kotlin on Android, Objective-C/Swift on iOS and macOS, oriel.hooks in Zig on the desktop.",
.date = .date("2026-10-12T00:00:00"),
